{
  "$comment": [
    "Third-party repositories this fork adapts files from, without being a fork of them.",
    "Check them: node --experimental-strip-types .claude/scripts/upstream-check.ts (run from the repo root; --help for options).",
    "pinned = the upstream commit the adaptations were written from, as cited in the license file.",
    "reviewed = the last upstream commit someone checked the adaptations against; the check reports what changed since.",
    "adaptations = each local file and the upstream files it adapts. A change there needs a human look.",
    "context = upstream files the adaptations lean on without copying them. A change there is worth a glance.",
    "watch_new = upstream globs where a new file may be worth adapting too.",
    "After a review, --record moves reviewed to the upstream head. Moving pinned is a separate decision: it means the adaptations were brought in line, and the license file's commit moves with it."
  ],
